<title>AUSTRALIA: RTRS-IAMA says year net profit rises.</title>
<headline>RTRS-IAMA says year net profit rises.</headline>
<dateline>PERTH 1996-11-20</dateline>
<text>
<p>Pastoral services group IAMA Ltd said on Wednesday that its net profit in the year to September 30 was A$15.5 million on sales of A$787 million.</p>
<p>The company said in the year-ago period, which consisted of 15 months, net profit was A$8.6 million and sales were A$685 million.</p>
<p>-- Sydney Newsroom 61-2 9373-1800</p>
</text>
